If source code is available, inspect:

* Bugs.
* Fragile logic.
* Duplicate code.
* Dead code.
* Hard-coded values.
* Poor naming.
* Security problems.
* Performance problems.
* Missing validation.
* Poor error handling.
* Unnecessary dependencies.
* Poor separation of concerns.
* Maintainability issues.
* Technical debt.
* Architectural weaknesses.

