16. Product & UX Improvements

Do not only find problems.

Suggest improvements that make the application:

* Easier to understand.
* Faster.
* More reliable.
* More secure.
* More accessible.
* More scalable.
* More professional.
* Easier to maintain.
* Better on mobile.
