19. Issue Format

For every issue, use:

Issue:
Clear description.

Severity:
Critical / High / Medium / Low

Category:
Bug / UX / UI / Security / Performance / Accessibility / Data / Architecture / Business Logic

Location:
Page, component, feature, workflow, or file.

Steps to Reproduce:
Exact steps when reproducible.

Expected Behavior:
What should happen.

Actual Behavior:
What currently happens.

Risk / Impact:
Why this matters.

Recommended Fix:
Specific practical recommendation.

Priority:
P0 / P1 / P2 / P3

If something cannot be reproduced, clearly label it as a Potential Risk rather than a confirmed bug.

